: "Turn Undead", "lfmax-3": "1", "lfrec-3": "SR", "lfused-3": "0", "lfname-4": "", "lfmax-4": "", "lfrec-4": "", "lfused-4": "", "lfname-5": "", "lfmax-5": "", "lfrec-5": "", "lfused-5": "", "lfname-6": "", "lfmax-6": "", "lfrec-6": "", "lfused-6": "", "lfname-7": "", "lfmax-7": "", "lfrec-7": "", "lfused-7": "", "hitdice": "3d8 + 5d6", "hd-total": "8", "hd-used": "0", "proficiencies": "Weapons: Simple weapons, martial weapons, daggers, darts, slings, quarterstaffs, light crossbows\nArmor: Light armor, medium armor, heavy armor, shields\nLanguages: Common", "pp": "0", "gp": "0", "ep": "0", "sp": "0", "cp": "0", "armorsel": "Half Plate Armor", "armor-custom": "", "armormod": "", "attune-0": "", "attune-1": "", "attune-2": "", "invname-0": "Half Plate Armor", "invqty-0": "1", "invname-1": "Shield", "invqty-1": "1", "invname-2": "Quarterstaff", "invqty-2": "1", "invname-3": "Spellbook", "invqty-3": "1", "invname-4": "Component Pouch", "invqty-4": "1", "invname-5": "Holy Symbol", "invqty-5": "1", "invname-6": "Backpack", "invqty-6": "1", "invname-7": "Clothes, Common", "invqty-7": "1", "invname-8": "", "invqty-8": "", "invname-9": "", "invqty-9": "", "invname-10": "", "invqty-10": "", "invname-11": "", "invqty-11": "", "invname-12": "", "invqty-12": "", "invname-13": "", "invqty-13": "", "invname-14": "", "invqty-14": "", "invname-15": "", "invqty-15": "", "invname-16": "", "invqty-16": "", "invname-17": "", "invqty-17": "", "invname-18": "", "invqty-18": "", "invname-19": "", "invqty-19": "", "invname-20": "", "invqty-20": "", "invname-21": "", "invqty-21": "", "invname-22": "", "invqty-22": "", "invname-23": "", "invqty-23": "", "invname-24": "", "invqty-24": "", "invname-25": "", "invqty-25": "", "invname-26": "", "invqty-26": "", "invname-27": "", "invqty-27": "", "invname-28": "", "invqty-28": "", "invname-29": "", "invqty-29": "", "invname-30": "", "invqty-30": "", "invname-31": "", "invqty-31": "", "invname-32": "", "invqty-32": "", "invname-33": "", "invqty-33": "", "equipment": "", "features": "Arcane Recovery. Once per day when you finish a short rest, you can choose expended spell slots to recover — up to a combined level of 3, and none of the slots can be 6th level or higher.\n\nAwakened Spellbook. When you cast a wizard spell with a spell slot, you can temporarily replace its damage type with a damage type that appears in another spell in your spellbook of the same level — for example, cast fireball as lightning damage, ready to be maximized with Destructive Wrath. When you cast a wizard spell as a ritual, you can use its normal casting time instead of adding 10 minutes, once per long rest. Whenever you finish a long rest and consult your spellbook, you can replace one wizard cantrip you know with another cantrip from the wizard spell list.\n\nWizardly Quill. The magical quill you summon never needs ink, and it lets you copy a spell into your spellbook in just 2 minutes per level of the spell.\n\nTempest Domain Spells. You always have fog cloud and thunderwave prepared (from 1st level), and gust of wind and shatter (from 3rd level). These spells don't count against the number of cleric spells you can prepare, and they count as cleric spells for you.\n\nBonus Proficiencies (Tempest Domain). You gain proficiency with martial weapons and heavy armor. This build fights in half plate armor and a shield instead (AC 19), keeping a component pouch as its focus.\n\nWrath of the Storm. When a creature within 5 feet of you that you can see hits you with an attack, you can use your reaction to cause the creature to make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 13). The creature takes 2d8 lightning or thunder damage (your choice) on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (2), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.\n\nChannel Divinity: Destructive Wrath. When you roll lightning or thunder damage, you can use your Channel Divinity to deal maximum damage instead of rolling. You have one use of Channel Divinity, which you regain when you finish a short or long rest; it also fuels Turn Undead.\n\nChannel Divinity: Turn Undead. As an action, you present your holy symbol and speak a prayer censuring the undead. Each undead within 30 feet of you that can see or hear you must make a Wisdom saving throw (DC 13). If it fails, it is turned for 1 minute or until it takes any damage.\n\nRitual Casting. You can cast any wizard spell in your spellbook as a ritual if it has the ritual tag, and any cleric spell you have prepared as a ritual if it has the ritual tag.", "spellclass": "Wizard", "spellability": "int", "slot1": "4", "slot1u": "", "slot2": "3", "slot2u": "", "slot3": "3", "slot3u": "", "slot4": "2", "slot4u": "", "slot5": "", "slot5u": "", "slot6": "", "slot6u": "", "slot7": "", "slot7u": "", "slot8": "", "slot8u": "", "slot9": "", "slot9u": "", "age": "", "height": "", "weight": "", "eyes": "", "skin": "", "hair": "", "personality": "", "ideals": "", "bonds": "", "flaws": "", "bg-allies": "", "bg-enemies": "", "backstory": "", "notes": "Build notes: Wizard 5 (Order of Scribes) / Cleric 3 (Tempest Domain), built Cleric 1 -> Wizard 5 -> Cleric 2 -> Cleric 3. Multiclass caster level 8: spell slots 4/3/3/2 are ONE shared pool - track them on the Wizard sheet. Signature combo: cast Fireball as lightning via Awakened Spellbook, then maximize it with Channel Divinity: Destructive Wrath (48 damage). Wizard DC 15 / attack +7; Cleric DC 13 / attack +5. Saves: Wisdom + Charisma (Cleric starting class). Race and background are not chosen yet - pick them and add the background's two skill proficiencies.\n中文：法師 5（抄寫員學派）／牧師 3（暴風領域），升級路線：牧師 1 → 法師 5 → 牧師 2 → 牧師 3。兼職施法者等級 8：法術位 4/3/3/2 是同一個共享池——請在法師法術表上記錄。招牌連招：用覺醒法術書將火球術改為閃電屬性，再用引導神力：毀滅之怒取最大值（48 點）。法師 DC 15／攻擊 +7；牧師 DC 13／攻擊 +5。豁免熟練：感知＋魅力（牧師為起始職業）。種族與背景尚未選擇——選好後記得加上背景的兩項技能熟練。", "lfname-8": "", "lfmax-8": "", "lfrec-8": "", "lfused-8": "", "lfname-9": "", "lfmax-